{
  "id": 200587675,
  "iid": 9559,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Fix Personal Extcap folder path",
  "description": "The personal extcap folder was configured to the personal configuration\nfolder ($XDG_CONFIG_DIR/wireshark on Linux) but this is wrong.\n\nIt is wrong because it is inconsistent with the global extcap folder\n(lib/wireshark/extcap) and personal plugins folder\n(.local/lib/wireshark/plugins) and also because the configuration\nfolder should not contain architecture-specific files.\n\nThe extcap personal folder is changed from:\n\n    .config/wireshark/extcap\n\nto:\n\n    .local/lib/wireshark/extcap",
  "state": "merged",
